#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-SD1366 expect=violation domain=DM
#note "Row 1: reason recorded (ARMNRS=NOT ASSIGNED) and RFENDTC populated -> fires. Row 2: reason recorded but RFENDTC correctly empty -> conformant. Record-level Check, so exactly ONE violation, on row 1. Pin RFENDTC (space-free); do not pin ARMNRS, whose values contain spaces."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
#expectViolationCount 1
#expectViolationAt row=1 RFENDTC=2020-02-10
dataset DM label="Demographics"
col STUDYID type=Char
col DOMAIN  type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col RFSTDTC type=Char
col RFENDTC type=Char
col ARMNRS  type=Char
---
CDISCPILOT01 | DM | 01-701-1015 | | 2020-02-10 | NOT ASSIGNED
CDISCPILOT01 | DM | 01-701-1023 | | | NOT ASSIGNED
